> In case useful to other HPC-seekers, here’s a distilled list of resources (some are duplicates from those shared in this thread – thanks all!).
> Titus Brown's grad class materials: https://github.com/ngs-docs/2020-GGG298/ week 7 is about slurm and Farm.
> Ross-Ibarra’s guide: https://github.com/RILAB/lab-docs/wiki/Using-Farm
> Michael’s guide  https://mcmaurer.github.io/farm-cluster-intro/
> Campus resources main links:  https://wiki.cse.ucdavis.edu/farm_guide and  https://hpc.ucdavis.edu/cluster-helpsupport
